            "review_text": "Sergey B\n3 contributions\n0\nAn outlet if tired of Asian cuisine\nNov 2025 • Couples\nA very nice place. The entrance is off the street. If you don't know, you don't just walk in. We were brought in for lunch from a field trip and I didn't have much hope, but it was a mistake and it's a case of making a mistake is nice. They served really good snacks, I only ate from the oven. There was also a very soft and juicy barbecue. It's really nice. Yes, the interior is simple unpretentious. But the kitchen compensates. I wish the establishment development and prosperity.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten November 24, 2025",
